      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maynard%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Every July, Maynard hosts a lively Fourth‑of‑July celebration and an annual rodeo that draw regional crowds.",
